IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `cta-licensing`

-- Commodity Trading Act 1992, ss 4, 8, 12, 13, 13A, 14A, 32, 33, 49, 57, 58, 60 and the Schedule -- worked cases.
--
-- Every assertion is a claim about the ENCODING on stated facts, not about the law. Nothing here has been checked
-- against a decided case or subsidiary legislation (none was retrieved).
--
-- Fixtures are generated from a table of which flags are set (scratchpad gen_commodity-trading-act-1992.py). Expected results were written by
-- hand from the text.

