#ASSERT `the 2018 cessation applies` `a new pool operator`
#ASSERT NOT `the 2018 cessation applies` `a new spot broker, unlicensed`
#ASSERT NOT `the 2018 cessation applies` `a new spot pool operator, unlicensed`
#ASSERT NOT `the 2018 cessation applies` `an old broker, unlicensed`

